      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Stryker’s</span> Dual Mobility</span> constructs have demonstrated <span class=\"futura-bold\">stability<sup>1-3</sup></span> and <span class=\"futura-bold\">adaptability</span> with monobloc and modular constructs, that can be cementless or cemented, based on primary, complex or revision indications.<sup>1-3​<br>\n </sup>​<br>\n We are committed to being your Dual Mobility provider of choice with a <span class=\"futura-bold\">comprehensive portfolio</span> of monobloc, modular and cementless Dual Mobility options, backed by over <span class=\"futura-bold\">50 years of innovation</span>.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
